      "content": "wait, 10-15 grams?? that sounds like a lot... are you sure that's safe to do all at once or in such a short window? i've read somewhere that too much acetaminophen can be really bad for your liver. i'm just scared of messing up. is that really a standard way to do a 'loading dose' for intense pain like this?",
